   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Raja Vocative**: back after 36 archived shows (897 days) [4]\n- **So Desperate**: back after 71 archived shows (1455 days) [4]\n- **Itzcuintli-Totzli Days**: back after 96 archived shows (1793 days); rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2022-04-29** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 22 songs; 107 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **tmg2022-04-29.aud.mv88.flac24**: audience recording; 22 songs; 107 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: banter No Children [1]\n- The reviewer and his wife stood by the sound board when the uploader arrived to plug in [3]\n- The reviewer missed out on the uploader's stickers at this show and at the LA show [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2022-04-29**: taped by me; transferred by me; source: SBD > PCM-A10 + CA-14 (healy onstage) > CA-Ugly 2 > PCM-M10 [1]. Also: The recording being reviewed is a matrix of this April 29, 2022 show [3]\n- **tmg2022-04-29.aud.mv88.flac24**: taped by One Dozen Cats; source: MV88 > iPhone 8 > WAV (24/48) [2]",
